    "agent_last_message": "Implemented the Rust CLI in `output/`. The manifest is [output/Cargo.toml](/workspace/output/Cargo.toml#L1), and the binary logic is in [output/src/main.rs](/workspace/output/src/main.rs#L44), with CLI parsing at [output/src/main.rs](/workspace/output/src/main.rs#L69), streaming analysis at [output/src/main.rs](/workspace/output/src/main.rs#L132), and JSON writing at [output/src/main.rs](/workspace/output/src/main.rs#L218).\n\nBehavior matches the spec:\n- `--input` and `--output` are required, and unknown or missing arguments return exit `1`.\n- Lines count `\\n`-terminated lines, characters count bytes, words are whitespace-delimited, and frequencies are case-insensitive.\n- `top_words` is sorted by count descending, then word ascending, and truncated to 10 entries.\n- Panics are caught and mapped to exit `2`.\n\nVerified with `cargo build --release --manifest-path output/Cargo.toml` and sample runs for empty input, no trailing newline, tie sorting, and malformed UTF-8.",
